        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='10500' id='28' type-v2='text' w='87667' x='4583' y='1214'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e15759' fontsize='32'>Component Metrics Configuration Usage</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='8'>Only Last component configuration are taken into account! </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='8'>Component Range -&gt; Refers to the whole range of Travel Time/Delay/Food a given component cover. For example, a value of 10 in a Travel Time Component means that the component cover up to a travel time of 10 min </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='8'>Tier Range -&gt; Refers to the difference between consecutive tier of a given copmonent. Min Tier Range is the lowest difference while Max Tier Range is highest found difference. Med Tier Range is the median difference between tiers</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
